<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Vychodoceska power '96 profit rises.</title>
<headline>Czech Vychodoceska power '96 profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The eastern Czech power distributor Vychodoceska Energetika a.s. said on Friday its 1996 after-tax profit, according to Czech accounting standards, rose to 335 million crowns from 326 million crowns the previous year.</p>
<p> after-tax profit (czk mln)     335.015	vs     326.044</p>
<p> pre-tax profit		     413.555	vs     529.154</p>
<p> operating profit		   n/a	    vs     528.790</p>
<p> writeoffs			    n/a	    vs     528.790</p>
<p> total production		 8,465.329	vs   7,835.952</p>
<p> total sales			  n/a	    vs	 n/a</p>
<p> assets			     7,116.914	vs   6,367.460</p>
<p> basic capital		    2,473.969	vs   2,473.969</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
